---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Creator Growth Tools and its editorial approach.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Independent editorial comparisons for creator tools.</h1>
    <p class="dek">
      Creator Growth Tools is a small MVP publication testing whether English-speaking creators and solo businesses want concise, practical SaaS comparisons before choosing newsletter and email marketing software.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
      <p>We separate verified vendor facts from editorial assessment. If we have not used a product first-hand, we do not claim hands-on testing or personal experience.</p>
      <h2>Current scope</h2>
      <p>The initial scope is limited to newsletter, email marketing, and audience growth tools. The first affiliate candidates are Kit, beehiiv, and ActiveCampaign. HubSpot is tracked as a Phase 2 candidate after the site has real content and traffic data.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
